      "Reason": "Group operations call SendGroupValueRequest with Write/Read/Response service types; group observers are Guid sets per GroupId, starting LinkLocal and SiteLocal listening on first registration and stopping on final removal. Event add/remove use Combine/Remove and CompareExchange; received payloads are parsed and raised. Security authenticates via SPAKE, manages POST/GET/DELETE /auth/at entries and creates OSCORE access tokens from CBOR profile/scope/confirmation keys. Class1348/06001F0A explicitly logs the third authentication argument as OSCORE ID; the other string remains unproven. Software-update operations use /swu/pkgqurl, /swu/protocol, /swu/maxdefer, /swu/method, /a/swu, /swu/update, /swu/pkgbytes, /swu/pkgv, /swu/state, /swu/result and /swu/lastupdate. Class1348/06001F24 slices packageData with offset/length and formats po/ps. The existing firmware-name implementation throws NotImplementedException; logger value 1 versus stack write 0 for TriggerSoftwareUpdate is preserved. Existing GetVersion/GetPackages share pkgv and remain unchanged. ParseOscoreAccessToken corrects a transport alias because every successful path constructs v2 access token using v3 confirmation key, while DTLS throws. No behavior is changed."
    }
